  "source_bytes": 1288,
  "provenance": "Canonical producer CSV/receipt are unchanged accepted R05 saved artifacts. Other full byte inputs are explicit representation derivatives or hand-written receipt/CSV contract controls, not external adoption or MDF semantic oracle claims.",
